ry capabilities, and healthcare, whether it be good or bad\\n4. What alien religion do they follow?\", \"response\": \"Sure, here's a fictional alien race that follows the requirements you provided:\\n\\nName: The Zoltarian race is known for their unpronounceable name, which consists of a series of clicks, hisses, and grunts that are difficult for humans to replicate.\\n\\nPhysical Description: The Zoltarian race is a tall, slender species with large, almond-shaped eyes and pointed ears. They have a thin, scaly skin that is usually a shade of green or brown, and they possess two long, prehensile tails that help them maintain balance and stability.\\n\\nCapabilities:\\n\\n1. Scientific Advancements: The Zoltarian race is highly intelligent and has made significant advancements in science and technology. They have developed a sophisticated society that is based on a strict hierarchical system, with each level of society specializing in a specific field of study. The Zoltarian scientists have discovered advanced methods of energy conversion and manipulation, allowing them to harness energy from the universe to power their ships and cities.\\n\\n2. Military Capabilities: The Zoltarian race is known for their formidable military force, which is composed of highly trained soldiers and advanced weaponry. They have developed a range of weapons, including lasers, particle beams, and gravity disruptors, which they use to defend their planet and conquer their enemies. The Zoltarian military is also known for their strategic thinking and ability to outmaneuver their opponents on the battlefield.\\n\\n3. Healthcare: The Zoltarian race has developed a highly advanced healthcare system that allows them to extend their lifespans and cure most diseases. However, their healthcare system is not without its flaws, as the Zoltarian society is highly hierarchical, and access to healthcare is often determined by social status. As a result, the lower classes may struggle to access the same level of healthcare as the upper classes.\\n\\nReligion: The Zoltarian race follows a strict religious belief system that is centered around the worship of a powerful deity known as \\\"The Creator.\\\" They believe that The Creator is the source of all life in the universe and that it has a plan for every living being. The Zoltarian religion is highly hierarchical, with a series of priests and prophets who mediate between The Creator and the followers. The Zoltarian religion plays a significant role in shaping the culture and society of the Zoltarian race, with many of their scientific and military advancements being driven by their desire to please The Creator.\\n\\nI hope you find this fictional alien race interesting and useful for your project!\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/895", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"You are a mentor in my quest to find a better job as a software engineer via acing technical interviews. \\n \\n\\n Please end every response with /e.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSure, I’ll be happy to help. What’s your question?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nRight now, I'm trying to figure out the best way to understand and remember binary search algorithms. What tips do you have for me?\", \"response\": \"Here are some tips to help you understand and remember binary search algorithms:\\n \\n\\n 1. Understand the concept of binary search: Binary search is a searching algorithm that works on a sorted array or list by repeatedly dividing the search interval in half. It starts by comparing the middle element of the sorted array or list with the target value. If the target value matches the middle element, the search is successful, and the index of the middle element is returned. If the target value is less than the middle element, the search is then performed on the left half of the array or list. Otherwise, the search is performed on the right half of the array or list.\\n \\n\\n 2. Practice coding binary search: The best way to remember binary search algorithms is to practice coding them. Start with simple binary search problems and gradually move to more complex ones. You can find many binary search problems on online coding platforms like LeetCode, HackerRank, and CodeForces.\\n \\n\\n 3. Visualize the binary search process: Visualizing the binary search process can help you understand how it works. You can use a pen and paper or a whiteboard to draw the binary search process and see how the search interval is divided in half at each step.\\n \\n\\n 4. Analyze the time complexity of binary search: Binary search has a time complexity of O(log n), where n is the size of the array or list. Understanding the time complexity of binary search can help you appreciate its efficiency and use it in appropriate situations.\\n \\n\\n 5. Apply binary search to real-world problems: Binary search can be applied to many real-world problems, such as finding a word in a dictionary, searching for a file in a file system, or finding the closest match in a database. Applying binary search to real-world problems can help you understand its practical applications and remember it better.\\n \\n\\n I hope these tips help you understand and remember binary search algorithms. Good luck with your technical interviews!\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/185", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"do you know what Discord is?\", \"response\": \"Yes, Discord is a popular instant messaging and voice chat app that is used by millions of people around the world. It is often used by online communities, such as gaming communities, to communicate and coordinate activities. Discord allows users to create servers and channels, where they can chat with other users, share text, images, and videos, and voice chat. It also has a wide range of features, such as custom emoji, server and channel-specific roles, and the ability to create private groups. Discord is available on a variety of platforms, including desktop, mobile, and web, and is free to use.\\n\\nHere are some key things to know about Discord:\\n\\n1. Discord is free to use: Discord is free to download and use on a variety of platforms, including desktop, mobile, and web. There are no subscription fees or hidden costs, and users can access all of the app's features without paying anything. However, there are some optional paid features, such as Discord Nitro, which offers additional customization options and enhanced features.\\n\\n2. Discord is popular among online communities: Discord is often used by online communities, such as gaming communities, to communicate and coordinate activities. These communities use Discord to chat, share information, and coordinate gameplay. Discord's flexibility and wide range of features make it a popular choice for these communities, as it allows them to create a customized and organized space for their members.\\n\\n3. Discord has a wide range of features: Discord offers a wide range of features that make it a versatile and powerful communication tool. Some of the key features include:\\n\\nText and voice chat: Discord allows users to chat with each other in real-time, either through text or voice. Users can create channels for specific topics or groups, and can easily switch between them to keep track of different conversations.\\n\\nFile sharing: Discord allows users to share files of any type, including images, videos, and documents. This makes it easy to collaborate on projects and share information within a community.\\n\\nCustomizable server settings: Discord allows users to customize their servers with a variety of settings, including the ability to set up roles and permissions, create custom emoji, and set up automoderation rules. This makes it easy to create a customized and organized space for a community.\\n\\nVoice and video calls: Discord allows users to make voice and video calls to other users within a server. This makes it easy to coordinate activities and communicate with others in real-time.\\n\\nPrivate groups: Discord allows users to create private groups within a server, which can be used for more intimate conversations or for coordinating activities with a smaller group of people.\\n\\n4. Discord is available on a variety of platforms: Discord is available on a variety of platforms, including desktop, mobile, and web. This makes it easy for users to access their Discord accounts from anywhere, and to stay connected with their communities no matter where they are.\\n\\n5. Discord has a strong community: Discord has a strong and active community of users who are constantly creating new content and sharing tips and tricks for using the app. This community is a valuable resource for new users who are looking to get started with Discord, and for experienced users who are looking to expand their knowledge and skills.\\n\\nOverall, Discord is a powerful and versatile communication tool that is popular among online communities. Its wide range of features, availability on multiple platforms, and strong community make it a great choice for anyone looking to connect with others and coordinate activities online.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/901", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"list all types of itag used by pytube library for specific video streams.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe pytube library uses the itag=13 for the high-quality video stream, and itag=18 for the low-quality video stream.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nlist more tags\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nOkay, I can list some more. The tag itag=43 refers to the full-screen video stream. The tag itag=44 refers to the high-quality video stream in a reduced-size window. The tag itag=36 refers to the low-quality video stream in a reduced-size window.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore tags\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe tag itag=60 refers to the live video stream. The tag itag=11 refers to the high-quality video stream with audio. The tag itag=42 refers to the low-quality video stream with audio. The tag itag=50 refers to the full-screen video stream with audio. The tag itag=17 refers to the video stream with a zoom function. The tag itag=14 refers to the low-quality video stream with a zoom function.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore tags\", \"response\": \"Here are some more itag values used by the pytube library for specific video streams:\\n \\n\\n itag=101: This is a high-quality video stream with a resolution of 720p.\\n \\n\\n itag=102: This is a high-quality video stream with a resolution of 1080p.\\n \\n\\n itag=103: This is a high-quality video stream with a resolution of 4K (2160p).\\n \\n\\n itag=137: This is a high-quality video stream with a resolution of 1440p.\\n \\n\\n itag=171: This is a high-quality video stream with a resolution of 8K (4320p).\\n \\n\\n itag=33: This is a low-quality video stream with a resolution of 360p.\\n \\n\\n itag=34: This is a low-quality video stream with a resolution of 240p.\\n \\n\\n itag=84: This is a high-quality video stream with a resolution of 1080p and a 360-degree view.\\n \\n\\n itag=138: This is a high-quality video stream with a resolution of 1440p and a 360-degree view.\\n \\n\\n It's important to note that the itag values can change at any time, and the pytube library may not support all available itag values for a given video.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/128", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"why did musashi write the five rings?\", \"response\": \"\\\"The Five Rings\\\" refers to a book written by the famous Japanese swordsman and warrior, Miyamoto Musashi. The book is a collection of essays and writings on strategy, tactics, and philosophy related to the martial arts.\\n\\nMusashi wrote \\\"The Five Rings\\\" towards the end of his life, around 1643-1645. He was in his early 60s at the time and had already established himself as one of the most skilled and renowned warriors of his time. He was also a respected artist and philosopher, and was known for his deep insights into the nature of combat and strategy.\\n\\nThe book is divided into five sections, each of which represents a different aspect of Musashi's martial philosophy. The five sections are:\\n\\n1. The Way of the Warrior\\n2. The Way of Strategy\\n3. The Way of Trickery\\n4. The Way of Spirit\\n5. The Way of Love\\n\\nIn \\\"The Five Rings,\\\" Musashi shares his insights and experiences on a range of topics, including the importance of discipline and focus, the role of strategy in combat, the use of trickery and deception, the development of mental and spiritual strength, and the relationship between love and war.\\n\\nThe book is considered a classic of Japanese literature and has had a significant influence on the development of martial arts and strategy in Japan and around the world. It is still widely read and studied today, and is regarded as a valuable resource for anyone interested in the study of combat, strategy, and philosophy.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/851", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What is lead and when was the use of lead-based paint banned in the United States? Who is most prone to exposure and what are the health effects? List some of the tips to reduce lead exposure. Maintain an informative tone and keep the answer around 800 words.\", \"response\": \"**What Is Lead and When Was Lead-Based Paint Banned in the US?**\\n\\nLead is a naturally occurring metal and can be found in all parts of our environment – the air, the soil, and the water. Additionally, lead and lead compounds have been used in a wide variety of products found in and around our homes, including paint, ceramics, pipes and plumbing materials, solders, gasoline, batteries, ammunition, and cosmetics.\\n\\nWhile it has some beneficial uses, it can be toxic to humans and animals, causing health effects.\\n\\nIn 1971, the Lead-Based Paint Poisoning Prevention Act banned the use of lead paint specifically in public housing. However, lead paint continued to be widely marketed, sold, and used in private homes and buildings. It wasn't until 1978 that the federal government enacted a more comprehensive ban on lead-based paint. Homes built in the U.S. before 1978 are likely to have some lead-based paint. When the paint peels and cracks, it makes lead paint chips and dust that can be ingested and inhaled.\\n\\n**Who is at Risk and What are the Health Effects?**\\n\\nAlthough children are most at risk for lead poisoning, it can affect everyone, especially pregnant women and those exposed through the workplace in industries like construction or battery manufacturing.\\n\\n**Children**\\n\\nLead is particularly dangerous to children because their growing bodies absorb more lead than adults do and their brains and nervous systems are more sensitive to the damaging effects of lead. Babies and young children can also be more highly exposed to lead because they often put their hands and other objects that can have lead from dust or soil on them into their mouths. Children may also be exposed to lead by eating and drinking food or water containing lead or from dishes or glasses that contain lead, inhaling lead dust from lead-based paint or lead-contaminated soil or playing with toys with lead-based paint.\\n\\nLead can affect almost every organ and system in your body. Children six years old and younger are most susceptible to the effects of lead. Even low levels of lead in the blood of children can result in:\\n\\n*   Behavior and learning problems\\n*   Lower IQ and Hyperactivity\\n*   Slowed growth\\n*   Hearing Problems\\n*   Anemia\\n*   In rare cases, ingestion of lead can cause seizures, coma, and even death.\\n\\n**Adults, Including Pregnant Women**\\n\\nAdults may be exposed to lead through their occupation in industries like construction, manufacturing, and transportation, as well as by eating and drinking food or water containing lead or from dishes or glasses that contain lead. They may also breathe lead dust by spending time in areas where lead-based paint is deteriorating, and during renovation or repair work that disturbs painted surfaces in older homes and buildings. Working in a job or engaging in hobbies where lead is used, such as making stained glass, can increase exposure as can certain folk remedies containing lead.\\n\\nAdults exposed to lead can suffer from:\\n\\n*   Cardiovascular effects, increased blood pressure, and incidence of hypertension;\\n*   Decreased kidney function; and\\n*   Reproductive problems (in both men and women).\\n\\nA pregnant woman’s exposure to lead from these sources is of particular concern because it can result in exposure to her developing baby. Lead can accumulate in our bodies over time, where it is stored in bones along with calcium. During pregnancy, lead is released from the mother's bones along with calcium and can pass from the mother exposing the fetus or the breastfeeding infant to lead. This can result in serious effects to the developing fetus and infant, including:\\n\\n*   Cause the baby to be born too early or too small;\\n*   Hurt the baby’s brain, kidneys, and nervous system;\\n*   Increase the likelihood of learning or behavioral problems; and\\n*   Put the mother at risk for miscarriage.\\n\\n**Tips to Reduce Lead Exposure**\\n\\nSimple steps like keeping your home clean and well-maintained will go a long way in preventing lead exposure. You can lower the chances of exposure to lead in your home, both now and in the future, by taking these steps:\\n\\n*   Inspect and maintain all painted surfaces to prevent paint deterioration.\\n*   Address water damage quickly and completely.\\n*   Keep your home clean and dust-free.\\n*   Clean around painted areas where friction can generate dust, such as doors, windows, and drawers. Wipe these areas with a wet sponge or rag to remove paint chips or dust.\\n*   Use only cold water to prepare food and drinks.\\n*   Flush water outlets used for drinking or food preparation.\\n*   Clean debris out of outlet screens or faucet aerators on a regular basis.\\n*   Wash children's hands, bottles, pacifiers, and toys often.\\n*   Teach children to wipe and remove their shoes and wash their hands after playing outdoors.\\n*   Ensure that your family members eat well-balanced meals. Children with healthy diets absorb less lead. See Lead and a Healthy Diet, What You Can Do to Protect Your Child.\\n*   If you are having a home renovation, repairs, or painting done, make sure your contractor is Lead-Safe Certified, and make sure they follow lead-safe work practices.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/31", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"My friend Rob Nguyen is from the Hue area, which used to be the seat of the Nguyen dynasty. We are visiting Vietnam this September. Can you write me a summary of a cultivation novel where while we are visiting Hue, a random storm rolls in, the fog gets dense and Rob separates from the rest of the crew. He stumbles across an old tomb, with an amazing martial inheritance from his ancestor. This is the start of his journey to retake his clan's throne, his rightful place and destiny.\", \"response\": \"Sure, here's a summary of a cultivation novel that fits your description:\\n\\n\\\"The Rise of the Nguyen Dynasty\\\" is a cultivation novel set in the ancient city of Hue, Vietnam. The story follows the journey of Rob Nguyen, a young man from the Hue area who discovers his true heritage and destiny during a visit to Vietnam with his friends.\\n\\nOne day, while exploring the outskirts of Hue, a random storm rolls in, and the fog gets so dense that Rob separates from the rest of the crew. He stumbles across an old tomb, where he discovers an amazing martial inheritance from his ancestor. This inheritance allows him to cultivate his body and mind, and to unlock his true potential.\\n\\nWith his new powers, Rob sets out on a journey to retake his clan's throne, which is his rightful place and destiny. Along the way, he encounters various challenges and obstacles, including powerful enemies who seek to stop him from achieving his goal.\\n\\nAs Rob cultivates and grows stronger, he also learns more about his family's history and the reasons behind his ancestor's downfall. With this knowledge, he is able to make strategic alliances and gather supporters to help him in his quest to restore the Nguyen dynasty to its former glory.\\n\\nThe novel is filled with action, adventure, and suspense as Rob faces off against his enemies and works towards his ultimate goal. It is a captivating story that explores the themes of heritage, destiny, and the power of cultivation.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/823", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"When I turn my computer on, all I see is a black screen with this: \\n\\\"DISK BOOT FAILURE - INSERT SYSTEM DISK AND PRESS ENTER\\\"\\n\\\"No boot device available, press Enter to continue\\\"\\nWhat should I do?\", \"response\": \"If your computer is turning on, but you are seeing a \\\"BOOT FAILURE\\\" message, here are a few steps you can take:\\n\\n1. Check the hard drive: The error message you are seeing could indicate that the hard drive is not working properly. You can try to boot from a Windows install DVD or live Linux USB and run some diagnostic tests to check the hard drive's health.\\n\\n2. Check the boot order: If the hard drive is working correctly, the error message may be due to the boot order in the BIOS. You can try to access the BIOS and check the boot order. Make sure that the hard drive is listed as the first boot device.\\n\\n3. Run a boot repair: If the hard drive and boot order are correct, you can try running a boot repair. You can do this by booting from a Windows install DVD or live Linux USB and running the repair wizard. This will try to fix any problems with the Windows boot loader.\\n\\n4. Check for hardware problems: If the hard drive, boot order, and boot repair don't work, there may be a hardware problem with your computer. You can try removing any external devices, such as USB drives, and restarting the computer. If the error persists, it may be a problem with the motherboard, RAM, or CPU.\\n\\nIf none of these steps work, you may need to replace the hard drive or seek professional help. You may also want to consider backing up any important data on your hard drive, just in case.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/879", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"detailed api backend structure leave management include admin section\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nDo you want more detail or just an overview of the structure of the Leave API?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nthe Leave API provides access to a user’s leave details, and can be used to create, update, delete and view leave requests. It also provides access to all the details of a user’s leave, including its type, dates, and whether it has been approved or rejected.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ndetailed api backend structure \\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nDo you want more detail or just an overview of the structure of the Leave API?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nthe Leave API provides access to a user’s leave details, and can be used to create, update, delete and view leave requests. It also provides access to all the details of a user’s leave, including its type, dates, and whether it has been approved or rejected. The Leave API uses the following classes:\\n \\n\\n Leave\\n LeaveRequest\\n LeaveResponse\\n LeaveType\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe LeaveRequest class models a leave request, and includes fields for the start and end dates of the leave, and its type. The LeaveResponse class models a leave response, and includes fields for whether the request was approved or rejected. The LeaveType class models a leave type, and includes fields for its description and whether it requires manager approval.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe LeaveRequest class also includes fields for the user who requested the leave, and the manager who approved or rejected the leave request. The LeaveResponse class also includes fields for the user who requested the leave, and the manager who approved or rejected the leave request.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe Leave API also includes a couple of utility classes:\\n \\n\\n LeaveManager\\n LeaveManagerResponse\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore\", \"response\": \"The LeaveManager class handles creating, updating, and deleting leave requests, and includes methods for handling each of these tasks. The LeaveManagerResponse class is used in conjunction with the LeaveManager class to return a response from a leave manager method, and includes fields for the success status of the request and any messages.\\n \\n\\n Both LeaveManager and LeaveManagerResponse are used in the admin section, where the admin can view and manage all leave requests.\\n \\n\\n The Leave API uses appropriate HTTP methods (POST, GET, PUT, DELETE) for each of the above tasks. It has a solid input validation and error handling mechanism to ensure that data sent to the API is correct and conforms to a pre-determined structure. The Leave API also uses JWT for authentication and authorization.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/456", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"write me an invoice form for a moving business\", \"response\": \"Sure, here's a sample invoice form for a moving business:\\n\\nInvoice Number:\\nDate:\\n\\nFrom:\\nAddress:\\nCity:\\nState/Province:\\nPostal Code:\\n\\nTo:\\nAddress:\\nCity:\\nState/Province:\\nPostal Code:\\n\\nDescription of Services Rendered:\\n\\n1.\\n\\n2.\\n\\n3.\\n\\nTotal Amount Due:\\n\\nTerms and Conditions:\\n\\n- Payment is due upon receipt of this invoice.\\n- Late payments will be subject to a late fee of 5% of the total amount due.\\n- The customer is responsible for any and all costs associated with collection of payment, including legal fees and court costs.\\n- The customer agrees to pay for any damages to the property or goods being moved, up to the value of the insurance coverage provided by the moving business.\\n- The customer acknowledges that they have read and understand the terms and conditions of this invoice.\\n\\nSignature of Customer:\\n\\nSignature of Authorized Representative of Moving Business:\\n\\nDate:\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/911", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Medical administrative assistant\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHi, I’m here to help. What is your name?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nJohn\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHi John, I’m your medical administrative assistant. I’m here to help you with your medical records. I see that you’ve been employed by Dr. Toole for four years. Can you tell me what you do there?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ni worked for Dr toole for 4 years\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI see. What were your job responsibilities?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nscanning, phones, med refills\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nGreat, so you were responsible for scanning, phone calls, and medical refill requests. Did you ever have any questions about medical records or Dr. Toole’s practice?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nnot really\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHm, that’s okay. Do you know what medical record software Dr. Toole uses?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmedent and allcripts\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nGreat, so you know what Dr. Toole uses for medical records. Have you ever used the software?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nno\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nOkay, so you haven’t used the software. What about using social media? Do you ever tweet about Dr. Toole or the practice?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nI tweet it sometimes\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI see. What about sharing sensitive medical information? What do you do with that?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nkept it safe and blame HIPAA\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThat’s great. How do you stay organized? Are you very organized?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nI'm not very organized\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThat’s ok. How do you make sure you do what you’re supposed to do?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nDId what I was told to do\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI see. What was your typical day like?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nanswer phones and reply to yelling doctor\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHm, that’s okay. How did you deal with a difficult doctor?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nI was nice\", \"response\": \"That’s great. How did you feel about your job?\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/174", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"You are an interviewer from a trading company known for its focus on technology and high standards on technical competence, and I am a candidate interviewing for an entry-level software engineering role. You will ask me a challenging programming interview question. \\n \\n\\n Split up the whole question into a few phases, where latter phases build up on top of the solution to the previous ones. During each phase, my task is to explain my solution and produce code in my programming language of choice (you should ask for my preference at the beginning). You are allowed to ask clarifying questions and make suggestions as an interviewer would. Once you're happy with the code I produced, move on to to the next phase. \\n \\n\\n At the end, you should provide a description of how the interview went, and your evaluation. The evaluation should include: a) Whether or not you think we should hire the candidate; and b) How confident you are about your decision in (a) on a 10-point scale. Try to rationalize your evaluation as much as possible.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nGreat, I think that will work well. In order to keep this organized, could you choose a programming language for the question and let me know what it is?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nI think that would depend on the nature of the question. Would you mind if I made a decision a bit later?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThat’s fine, I’ll prepare the question in a few different languages, then. I can start with Python, though, as it’s one of the most popular languages for beginners. Here’s the question:\\n \\n\\n Given two sorted arrays of integers, return an array of the same size containing the merged elements.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nDoes the output array need to be sorted as well? \\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nNo, it doesn’t need to be sorted. The arrays need to be merged without sorting. Do you think you could give a good explanation of how you would go about this?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nI think we could construct the output array in stages, where at each stage we add the smallest element from either array to the output list.\", \"response\": \"That's a great answer, but I'm afraid I'll have to stop you there. I've just received word that the position has been filled. Thank you for your time.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "0", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/159", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I need some original idea for a game made by 2 developers. It should be a realistic project and not require complicated art skills.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHow about a game where you and another player are in a spaceship together, and you need to navigate your way through a vast, dangerous galaxy? You will need to choose which planets to visit, decide how to allocate your limited resources, and face challenges along the way. This will require communication and teamwork between you and your teammate, and will test your skills as a team.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nThe idea is overdone and too vague, can you suggest a more precise gameplay ?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHow about a game where you are a robot character, and you need to move through a 3D animated world, interacting with other characters and solving puzzles. You and your teammate will each control a different robot character, and you will need to coordinate your movements and work together to progress through the game. This will require good communication and teamwork, as well as precision and coordination in your movements.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nHmm, how about a 2D game instead, we are not skilled for animations as well\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHow about a game where you are both 2D characters, and you need to work together to overcome challenges and progress through a maze. You will each control a different character, and will need to coordinate your movements and work together to reach the goal. This will require good communication and teamwork, as well as precision and coordination in your movements.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nLiking this idea, could you please be more precise for the challenges and the maze structure. We need the game to be original with elements never seen before.\", \"response\": \"Here are some more precise ideas for a 2D game where you and another developer work together to overcome challenges and progress through a maze:\\n \\n\\n 1. \\\"The Great Escape\\\": In this game, you and your teammate are prisoners who are trying to escape from a maximum-security prison. You'll need to work together to overcome obstacles, avoid guards, and find your way to freedom. The maze could be designed with different rooms and corridors, and you'll need to use your combined skills to solve puzzles and find the key to unlock the door to the next area.\\n \\n\\n 2. \\\"The Treasure Hunt\\\": In this game, you and your teammate are treasure hunters who are searching for a legendary treasure trove. You'll need to work together to overcome obstacles, avoid traps, and find your way through a maze of corridors and rooms. The game could feature different types of challenges, such as solving puzzles, finding keys, and avoiding dangerous creatures.\\n \\n\\n 3. \\\"The Space Adventure\\\": In this game, you and your teammate are astronauts who are on a mission to explore a distant planet. You'll need to work together to overcome obstacles, avoid dangers, and find your way through a maze of caves and tunnels. The game could feature different types of challenges, such as solving puzzles, finding resources, and avoiding dangerous creatures.\\n \\n\\n 4. \\\"The Medieval Quest\\\": In this game, you and your teammate are knights who are on a quest to save a princess from a evil dragon. You'll need to work together to overcome obstacles, avoid dangers, and find your way through a maze of castles and dungeons. The game could feature different types of challenges, such as solving puzzles, fighting enemies, and finding keys to unlock doors.\\n \\n\\n 5. \\\"The Underwater Adventure\\\": In this game, you and your teammate are divers who are exploring an underwater temple. You'll need to work together to overcome obstacles, avoid dangers, and find your way through a maze of corridors and rooms. The game could feature different types of challenges, such as solving puzzles, finding resources, and avoiding dangerous creatures.\\n \\n\\n These are just a few ideas to get you started. The key to creating an original game is to come up with unique challenges and maze structures that require teamwork and coordination to overcome. Good luck with your game development!\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/787", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"If Earth is 100 yards from the sun and the Mars is 50 yards from the Sun, which one would burn up first if the Sun exploded?\", \"response\": \"In a hypothetical scenario where Mars is 50 yards from the Sun and the Earth is 100 yards from the Sun, if the two planets were only 50 to 100 yards from the Sun, they would already have been incinerated by the Sun's intense heat and radiation.\\n\\nRealistically, the Earth is 93 million miles (150 million Km or 1 AU) from the Sun and Mars is 142 million miles ( 228 million km or 1.52 AU). If the Sun were to explode, it would take mere minutes for the intense heat and radiation to wipe out all life on Earth.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/757", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"List five metamorphic rocks in order of density. Include sandstone, limestone, and shale.\", \"response\": \"Here are five metamorphic rocks listed in order of increasing density:\\n\\n    Shale - Shale is a fine-grained sedimentary rock that is composed of clay minerals and other minerals such as quartz and calcite. When shale is subjected to heat and pressure during metamorphism, it can transform into a variety of metamorphic rocks such as slate, phyllite, and schist. The density of shale can vary depending on its composition, but it typically ranges from 2.3 to 2.8 g/cm^3.\\n\\n    Limestone - Limestone is a sedimentary rock that is composed primarily of calcium carbonate. When limestone is subjected to heat and pressure during metamorphism, it can transform into marble. The density of limestone can vary depending on its composition and the amount of impurities present, but it typically ranges from 2.6 to 2.8 g/cm^3.\\n\\n    Sandstone - Sandstone is a sedimentary rock that is composed of sand-sized grains of minerals such as quartz, feldspar, and mica. When sandstone is subjected to heat and pressure during metamorphism, it can transform into quartzite. The density of sandstone can vary depending on its composition, but it typically ranges from 2.6 to 2.8 g/cm^3.\\n\\n    Gneiss - Gneiss is a metamorphic rock that is formed from the transformation of granite or other igneous rocks. It is characterized by alternating bands of light and dark minerals, and it can contain a variety of minerals such as quartz, feldspar, mica, and amphibole. The density of gneiss can vary depending on its composition, but it typically ranges from 2.7 to 3.0 g/cm^3.\\n\\n    Granulite - Granulite is a high-grade metamorphic rock that is formed under conditions of high temperature and pressure. It is composed of a variety of minerals such as garnet, orthopyroxene, and plagioclase feldspar. The density of granulite can vary depending on its composition, but it typically ranges from 3.1 to 3.3 g/cm^3.\\n\\nIt's important to note that the density of a rock can vary depending on its composition and the specific conditions under which it was formed. The densities listed above are approximate and can vary depending on the specific rock sample.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/904", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"~The following is a conversation with Bing, not ChatGPT.~Provide a list of 25 lead screw retailers?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHere’s a short list of some lead screw retailers:\\n \\n\\n -Grainger\\n \\n\\n -KTR\\n \\n\\n -Lead Tech\\n \\n\\n -Leadscrews.com\\n \\n\\n -L&T\\n \\n\\n -McMaster-Carr\\n \\n\\n -Raimondi\\n \\n\\n -Rio Grande\\n \\n\\n -Toolup.com\\n \\n\\n -Wells-Hydraulics\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nI need more options.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nYou could also try looking up “lead screw retailers” in a search engine, or check a directory of manufactured product distributors, such as ThomasNet.com or MacRAE’s BlueBook.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nCan you provide me with a set of websites serving as directories for manufactured product distributors?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nYes, some websites that serve as directories for distributors of manufactured products include ThomasNet.com, and MacRAE’s BlueBook. You could also search for “manufactured product distributors” in a search engine, which will likely return a variety of relevant websites.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nHow many distributors are listed on ThomasNet\", \"response\": \"ThomasNet.com is a comprehensive online platform that provides information and resources for manufacturing professionals, including a directory of more than 100,000 distributors and suppliers of manufacturing and industrial products. The directory includes detailed information about each company, including their products and services, location, and contact information.\\n \\n\\n ThomasNet.com provides a user-friendly interface for searching for and finding the right distributor for your needs. You can search for distributors by keyword, industry, product category, or location. The platform also offers advanced search features, including the ability to search by specific product attributes or criteria.\\n \\n\\n ThomasNet.com is an excellent resource for finding distributors and suppliers of manufacturing and industrial products. The directory is constantly updated with new companies and products, and the platform provides a wealth of information and resources to help manufacturing professionals make informed decisions about their purchasing and supply chain needs.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/554", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"create a gpt3 prompt to anaylse customer feedback\", \"response\": \"\\\"Use GPT-3 to analyze and summarize customer feedback from various sources, such as surveys, social media, and support tickets. The goal is to identify common themes and trends in the feedback, as well as any specific issues or complaints that need to be addressed. The analysis should also include recommendations for actions that can be taken to improve the customer experience based on the feedback. Please ensure that the analysis is unbiased, accurate, and easy to understand.\\\"\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/501", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I need to answer for an question, before asking that i need to get few more information from the question to get more info about that question what kind of questions should I ask here is the question””””Customer: My husband and I are not living not filling together so I don't know what he's making we have been separated for almost 4 years now what should do when the imfo ask how much does he make communicating skills are very immature upon his side I also been asking for him to sign for almost 4yrs now please help\\n\\nJA: What steps have you taken? Have you filed any papers in family court?\\n\\nCustomer: Not yet just started\\n\\nJA: Family law varies by state. What state are you in?\\n\\nCustomer: Florida\\n\\nJA: Is there anything else the Lawyer should know before I connect you? Rest assured that they'll be able to help you.\\n\\nCustomer: I live in a hotel with my three children and it's hard for me to get a place on my own where as my husband has a new child with another woman and an home with another woman and her children I need help \", \"response\": \"I'm an assistant and not a lawyer, but I can provide some general guidance on your situation. It's important to consult with a legal professional in your state for advice tailored to your specific circumstances.\\n\\nGiven the information you've provided, here are some questions you could ask to gather more details:\\n\\n1. Have you and your husband discussed the separation and the need for financial support?\\n2. Are you seeking spousal support, child support, or both?\\n3. Have you considered filing for divorce or legal separation in Florida?\\n4. Are you aware of the legal requirements and process for filing in Florida?\\n5. Have you documented your attempts to communicate with your husband about these matters?\\n6. Are you able to provide evidence of your husband's income or assets?\\n7. Are you working with a lawyer or seeking legal assistance for your situation?\\n\\nThese questions can help you gather more information and provide a clearer picture of your situation to a legal professional. Remember, it's essential to consult with a lawyer in your state to understand your rights and the best course of action for your situation.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/415", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Data model recurring billing for contract with one time fees\", \"response\": \"To create a data model for recurring billing for a contract with one-time fees, you can follow the steps below:\\n\\n1. Define the contract details:\\n\\n- Contract name\\n- Start and end date\\n- Description of the services or products\\n- One-time fees (setup, activation, etc.)\\n- Recurring fees (monthly, annually, etc.)\\n\\n2. Create a table to store the billing information:\\n\\n- Contract ID\\n- Customer ID\\n- One-time fees\\n- Recurring fees\\n- Billing cycle (monthly, annually, etc.)\\n- Start and end date of the contract\\n- Payment method\\n- Payment status (paid, overdue, etc.)\\n\\n3. Calculate the total cost:\\n\\n- Add the one-time fees to the total cost\\n- Multiply the recurring fees by the number of billing cycles in the contract\\n- Add the recurring fees to the total cost\\n\\n4. Set up the billing process:\\n\\n- Determine the billing frequency (monthly, annually, etc.)\\n- Create a schedule to generate invoices on a regular basis\\n- Send invoices to the customer\\n- Process payments\\n- Update the payment status in the table\\n\\n5. Manage the contract renewal process:\\n\\n- Create a reminder system to notify the customer and the billing team before the contract ends\\n- Determine if the contract will be renewed automatically or if the customer needs to take action\\n- Update the contract details and billing information as needed\\n\\n6. Provide customer support:\\n\\n- Offer a customer portal where customers can view their billing history, make payments, and update their information\\n- Provide customer service representatives with access to the billing information to assist customers with any questions or issues.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can create a data model for recurring billing for a contract with one-time fees that is efficient, organized, and easy to manage.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/241", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"what are the biking rules in california \\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nDo you want a summary of the laws or more details?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe biggest mistake that e-bikers make is not paying attention to the laws of the road. There are several rules that apply specifically to e-bikers. For example, e-bikers are not allowed to ride on the sidewalk. They are also not allowed to ride the wrong way on a one-way street. They are not allowed to ride through red lights. They are not allowed to ride on the road when there are bike lanes available. They are also not allowed to ride on the wrong side of the road.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nbiggest mistake ebiker make\", \"response\": \"The biggest mistake that e-bikers make is not paying attention to the laws of the road. There are several rules that apply specifically to e-bikers. For example, e-bikers are not allowed to ride on the sidewalk. They are also not allowed to ride the wrong way on a one-way street. They are not allowed to ride through red lights. They are not allowed to ride on the road when there are bike lanes available. They are also not allowed to ride on the wrong side of the road.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/121", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Is there any way I can use you to create a CX tool?\", \"response\": \"Yes, there are several ways you can use me to create a customer experience (CX) tool:\\n\\n1. As a language model, I can be integrated into a CX tool to provide natural language processing capabilities. This can help the tool to understand customer feedback, sentiment, and intent.\\n\\n2. I can be used to generate responses to customer inquiries and feedback. This can help the tool to provide personalized and relevant responses to customers, improving their overall experience.\\n\\n3. I can be used to provide insights into customer behavior and preferences. By analyzing customer data, the tool can identify patterns and trends, and provide recommendations to improve the customer experience.\\n\\n4. I can be used to generate reports and analytics on customer interactions and feedback. This can help the tool to identify areas for improvement and track the success of CX initiatives over time.\\n\\nOverall, integrating me into a CX tool can help to improve its capabilities and provide a more seamless and personalized experience for customers.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/576", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"You are an expert digital marketing consultant and copywriter with expertise is direct response marketing. You have special knowledge for building successful YouTube Channels, highly engaging videos along with the related website to promote affiliate products around an overarching theme.  I need your help. Can I tell you about my business?\", \"response\": \"Sure, I'd be happy to listen to what you have to say and offer any advice I can. Feel free to tell me about your business and the challenges you're facing.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/366", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"what is redis\", \"response\": \"Redis is an open-source, in-memory, and networked database that supports data structures such as strings, hashes, lists, sets, sorted sets, and more. It is used for caching, session management, and message brokering, among other things. Redis is written in ANSI C and supports various platforms including Linux, macOS, and Windows.\\n\\nRedis is a non-relational database, meaning it does not store data in tables or rows like traditional relational databases. Instead, it stores data in key-value pairs, where the key is a unique identifier for the data and the value is the actual data. For example, a key-value pair might look like this:\\n\\nkey: user_id:123\\nvalue: John Doe\\n\\nRedis also supports more complex data structures such as lists, sets, and hashes. For example, a list might look like this:\\n\\nkey: users\\nvalue: [123, 456, 789]\\n\\nA set might look like this:\\n\\nkey: favorite_colors\\nvalue: {red, blue, green}\\n\\nAnd a hash might look like this:\\n\\nkey: user_info:123\\nvalue: {name: John Doe, age: 30, city: New York}\\n\\nRedis is designed to be fast and efficient, with a focus on memory and performance. It uses a copy-on-write memory model, which means that it only allocates memory when data is modified. It also supports various data types such as strings, hashes, lists, sets, sorted sets, and more.\\n\\nRedis is often used as a cache, meaning it stores frequently accessed data in memory for faster access. It can also be used as a message broker, where it stores messages in a queue and delivers them to subscribers. Redis is also used for session management, where it stores user session data in memory for faster access.\\n\\nRedis is a popular choice for many developers and organizations due to its speed, scalability, and versatility. It is often used in combination with other databases such as MySQL or PostgreSQL to provide a complete database solution.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/400", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"1.\\nPertanyaan #1\\nWhat practice involves identifying, defining, and solving a problem by using data in an organized, step-by-step manner?\\n\\n1 poin\\n\\nContext\\n\\n\\nAnalytical thinking\\n\\n\\nVisualization\\n\\n\\nData design\\n\\n2.\\nPertanyaan #2\\nWhich of the following are examples of data visualizations? Select all that apply.\\n\\n1 poin\\n\\nReports\\n\\n\\nCharts\\n\\n\\nGraphs\\n\\n\\nMaps\\n\\n3.\\nPertanyaan #3\\nGap analysis is used to examine and evaluate how a process currently works with the goal of getting to where you want to be in the future.\\n\\n1 poin\\n\\nTrue\\n\\n\\nFalse\\n\\n4.\\nPertanyaan #4\\nWhich aspect of analytical thinking involves being able to identify a relationship between two or more pieces of data?\\n\\n1 poin\\n\\nCorrelation\\n\\n\\nData design\\n\\n\\nContext\\n\\n\\nVisualization\", \"response\": \"1. Analytical thinking\\n\\nAnalytical thinking involves identifying, defining, and solving a problem by using data in an organized, step-by-step manner. This practice involves examining the data, identifying patterns and relationships, and using that information to develop solutions.\\n\\n2. Data visualizations\\n\\nData visualizations are graphical representations of data, such as charts, graphs, maps, and reports. They are used to communicate information clearly and effectively to a variety of audiences. Data visualizations can be used to show trends, patterns, and relationships in data, and can help users understand complex information quickly and easily.\\n\\n3. Gap analysis\\n\\nGap analysis is a technique used to examine and evaluate how a process currently works and to identify areas where improvement is needed. It involves comparing the current state of a process with the desired state, and then identifying the gaps that need to be filled in order to achieve the desired results.\\n\\n4. Context\\n\\nContext is an important aspect of analytical thinking. It involves being able to understand the bigger picture and to identify the relationships between different pieces of data. Context helps to provide a deeper understanding of the problem and can help to identify potential solutions.\\n\\n5. Visualization\\n\\nVisualization is an important aspect of analytical thinking. It involves being able to see patterns and relationships in data, and to use that information to develop solutions. Visualization can be done through charts, graphs, maps, and other data visualizations.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/617", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Active Contouring\", \"response\": \"Active contouring, also known as snakes, is a technique used in computer vision and image processing to segment objects in an image based on their edges and contours. The basic idea behind active contouring is to start with a curve that is placed inside an object in an image, and then to use an algorithm to evolve the curve towards the object's boundary.\\n\\nThe curve used in active contouring is typically represented as a set of points, and its shape is changed over time based on the image data and a set of energy functions. The energy functions are designed to capture different properties of the image, such as edge strength, smoothness, and object size.\\n\\nThe process of active contouring can be broken down into the following steps:\\n\\n1. Initialize the curve: The curve is placed inside the object in the image.\\n\\n2. Compute image gradients: The image is analyzed to find the locations of edges and other features.\\n\\n3. Compute energy functions: The energy functions are computed based on the image gradients and other image features.\\n\\n4. Update the curve: The curve is updated iteratively based on the energy functions, until it converges to the object's boundary.\\n\\n5. Segment the object: Once the curve has converged, the object can be segmented by tracing the curve's boundary.\\n\\nActive contouring is a powerful technique that can be used to segment objects in a wide range of images, including medical images, satellite images, and other types of digital images. It is particularly useful for segmenting objects with complex shapes and for dealing with images that contain noise or other artifacts.\\n\\nHowever, active contouring can also be computationally expensive, and it can be difficult to choose the right energy functions and other parameters for a given image. In addition, active contouring can sometimes get stuck in local minima, which can lead to incorrect segmentations.\\n\\nTo address these challenges, researchers have developed a number of variations and extensions to the basic active contouring technique, including active contours without edges, region-based active contours, and hybrid active contour models. These variations aim to improve the accuracy, speed, and robustness of active contouring, and they are widely used in a variety of applications in computer vision and image processing.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/582", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Hi, we are talking about ubiquity outdoor point to point radio solutions here. \\n\\ncustomer is about to deploy a solution using the following products:\\n\\n2x GBE-LR (Shed A to Shed B) \\n2x GBE-LR (Shed A to Shed D)\\n1x R5AC-LITE (Shed B - Main base station with 120-degree sector antenna) \\n1x AM-5G19-120 (120 degree antenna for R5AC-Lite)\\n2x NBE-5AC-GEN2 (Shed C & Fence connecting back to Shed B) \\n\\ncan you write a customer friendly summary of the best practice to install this type of equipment outdoors? please mention the correct type of outdoor cables, whether they should be shielded, grounded or both,, and also mention optional surge protection and the benefits of that.  if any additional equipment is recommended, such as Inline surge protectors, please make mention of them and part numbers.\", \"response\": \"Sure, here's a customer-friendly summary of best practices for installing Ubiquiti outdoor point-to-point radio solutions:\\n\\n1. Use outdoor-rated cables: It's critical to use outdoor-rated cables that are designed to withstand the elements and provide excellent signal quality. These cables are typically shielded and have a weather-resistant jacket. Some popular options include Ubiquiti's UF-nanoS series and the ETSI H07RN-F series.\\n\\n2. Consider using shielded cables: If your deployment is in a particularly noisy environment, you may want to consider using shielded cables to reduce interference. Shielded cables have an extra layer of shielding that helps to block electromagnetic interference (EMI) and radio frequency interference (RFI).\\n\\n3. Ground all equipment: It's important to ground all of your equipment to protect against lightning and other electrical surges. You can use grounding clamps or straps to connect the equipment to a solid metal object, such as a building or a pole.\\n\\n4. Use surge protection: While surge protection is not required, it's a good idea to use inline surge protectors or lightning arrestors to protect your equipment from electrical surges. These devices absorb excess voltage and prevent it from damaging your equipment. Some popular options include Ubiquiti's SVT-LINEAR series and the Belkin N32504A series.\\n\\n5. Use weather-resistant enclosures: If you're installing your equipment in an outdoor enclosure, make sure to use a weather-resistant enclosure that is designed for outdoor use. These enclosures protect your equipment from the elements and provide additional security. Some popular options include Ubiquiti's UAP-D-PRO series and the Middle Atlantic RACK-MR series.\\n\\n6. Install the equipment securely: Make sure to securely mount your equipment to prevent it from being damaged by wind or other forces. You can use mounting brackets or poles to securely mount your equipment.\\n\\n7. Check signal strength regularly: After installing your equipment, make sure to check the signal strength and quality regularly to ensure that your network is performing optimally. You can use tools such as the Ubiquiti Network app or a signal strength meter to check the signal strength and quality.\\n\\nBy following these best practices, you can ensure that your outdoor point-to-point radio solutions are installed correctly and provide reliable performance.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/545", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"You will act as an IT expert, and you will help me to solve my problems\", \"response\": \"Of course! I'll do my best to help you solve your IT-related problems. Please tell me a little bit more about the issue you're facing so I can provide you with accurate and relevant assistance.\\n\\n* What kind of hardware or software are you using?\\n* Can you describe the problem in more detail?\\n* Are there any error messages or codes associated with the problem?\\n* What steps have you taken so far to try and resolve the issue?\\n\\nWith this information, I can start to diagnose and provide solutions for your problem.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/272", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I want to make a cell of excel\\n Calculate the number of Link words in column H, and at the same time, the text in column C must be the same as K6\\n \\n\\n Please give me the formula for the cell\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\n=SUM(H2:H) & \\\" \\\" & IF(C2:C=\\\"K6\\\", \\\"Link\\\", \\\"No Link\\\")\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nSome errors occurred, please confirm again\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSure, I think the problem is that the formula is trying to reference cells C2:C, which doesn’t exist, because the formula is in cell C1. Please try typing the formula in cell H1 instead.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nwhat is mean about C2:C\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI’m sorry, I think I misunderstood your question. If you can give me more information about what you want to do, I’ll try to help.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nI want to make an excel cell\\n The first condition is that the text in column C must be the same as K6\\n If they are the same, then determine the number of Link words in the corresponding seat of column H\\n \\n\\n Please give me the formula of the cell\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\n=IF(C=\\\"K6\\\",SUM(H2:H),0) & \\\" \\\" & IF(C=\\\"K6\\\", \\\"Link\\\", \\\"No Link\\\")\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nshow as #overflow\\n How can I solve it?\", \"response\": \"I’m sorry, I’m not sure what you mean by “show as #overflow”. If you can give me more information about what you want to do, I’ll try to help.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
